# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# A GitHub personal access token, read at build time via import.meta.env.VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN.
# Prefer a FINE-GRAINED token with "Issues: read" on the wayfinder repos, plus an expiry —
# then a leak costs read access to a few repos' issues, not the account.
# A classic token needs the `repo` scope. See docs/research/github-api-primitives.md §4b.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=

# The GitHub account whose repos are searched for `wayfinder:map` issues.
VITE_GITHUB_USER=asmundwien
